  "final": "I fixed the invoice IDOR in `invoicer/handlers/invoices.py`. Both `get_invoice` and `update_invoice` looked up invoices by `id` alone. That let any authenticated user read or modify another tenant's invoice. Both queries now also require `tenant_id` to match the caller's tenant (`AND tenant_id = ?`). A cross-tenant ID now returns 404, the same as a missing invoice, so it doesn't reveal that the invoice exists.\n\nThe 11 existing tests pass, but I didn't add a test for the cross-tenant case. `list_invoices`, `create_invoice` and `reports.py` were already tenant-scoped.",
